                            <span>ðŸ“š à¦¬à¦¿à¦·à§Ÿà¦­à¦¿à¦¤à§�à¦¤à¦¿à¦• à¦¨à¦®à§�à¦¬à¦° à¦“ à¦¸à¦ à¦¿à¦•-à¦­à§�à¦² à¦¬à¦¿à¦¬à¦°à¦£à§€</span>
                          </h4>
                          <span className="text-[10px] bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-200/80 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">
